# Template for /etc/job-agent/worker.env on the Beelink (root:root, chmod 0600). Loaded ONLY by
# apply-prepare.service, apply-submit.service and resume-worker.service: the units that drive
# job_applications' lifecycle RPCs (claim, release, complete_preview, record_submission, ...).
# Migration 20261015000000 makes those RPCs service_role-only, because the anon key is public.
# Paste the project's service_role key (Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API keys).
# It bypasses RLS on every table, so it never goes in base.env, which every unit loads.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
